eight bidirectional pairs (`g_α^{x'}<->g_α^x`, `g_α^{y'}<->g_α^y`, `g_β^{x'}<->g_β^x`,
`g_β^{y'}<->g_β^y`, `g_α^x<->g_α^y`, `g_β^x<->g_β^y`, `c^x<->c^{x'}`, `c^y<->c^{y'}`), and the
