`r(zAxy)`, `r(zAyy')` and returns to the loop with `aux` drawn from
`Sum.inl v0' :: rest`. Twenty `Command.RunStep`s. -/
theorem guessAY_blockRest_continue_step (I : PCPInstance) (v : Fin I.n) (v0' : Option (Fin I.n))
    (rest : List (GuessAY.Vals I))
    (φ : (GuessAY.Vocab I).Store) (hfst : φ GuessAY.Vars.fst = Sum.inr (Sum.inr false))
    (k : Fin 4) (hcnt0 : φ GuessAY.Vars.cnt = Sum.inr (Sum.inl k))
