/-- The `primeAY`/`guessAY` pair on `zAyy'`: `guessAY` makes `kws.length`
`zAyy'`-reads, as many as `primeAY` makes writes. -/
theorem primeAY_guessAY_zAyy'_rf_total (I : PCPInstance) (js : List (Fin I.n))
